ontent,\n            int index\n    ) {\n        return new DocumentChunk(\n                chunkIdFactory.newId(),\n                document.documentId(),\n                document.tenantId(),\n                index,\n                ChunkType.SECTION_TEXT,\n                section.heading(),\n                section.headingPath(),\n                content,\n                tokenEstimator.estimate(content),\n                Hashing.sha256(content),\n                ChunkMetadataFactory.from(document, section)\n        );\n    }\n}\n"
